    },
    {
      "text": "Combine evaporated milk, 1/2 cup butter, chocolate chips, and confectioners' sugar in a saucepan over medium heat. Bring to a boil, and cook 8 minutes, stirring constantly. Remove from heat, and stir in vanilla extract. Allow to cool thoroughly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CSExLKx3sd6s8Lo8HX7eh-BjeeY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/45587-five-layer-ice-cream-bars-VAT-006-step-02-c885cc9059cb495b8c3bf176e1b4742e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/45587/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix crushed chocolate sandwich cookies and 1/2 cup melted butter in a large bowl until combined. Press onto the bottom of a 9x13 inch pan; freeze until firm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/J_NxIkUumEeQUd-RMtF2x4UCoyY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/45587-five-layer-ice-cream-bars-VAT-007-step-03-3cbd62ec5d1249d1818914ec08d97b5a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/45587/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread softened ice cream over crust, then freeze until firm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/inRHBlPFQRfQqSzAGay-S6p3lnI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/45587-five-layer-ice-cream-bars-VAT-008-step-04-be43e74549e04b528b27ddb38513ce14.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/45587/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread top with cooled fudge sauce, and sprinkle with peanuts; freeze until firm. Spread with whipped topping, and freeze until firm, or overnight.",
